    {
      "comment": "Deep Freeze overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\u2019s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect.",
      "oracle_id": "648aead4-dc0b-47bc-911c-8dcd2cfd32d3",
